msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_005"
msgid "Reactivate automatic defenses\\n"
msgstr "Réactiver les défenses automatiques\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_006"
msgid "Release hostages\\n"
msgstr "Libérer les otages\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_007"
msgid "Retrieve experimental weapon\\n"
msgstr "Récupérer l'arme expérimentale\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_008"
msgid "Destroy sensitive information\\n"
msgstr "Détruire les informations sensibles\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_009"
msgid "Deactivate bomb\\n"
msgstr "Désactiver la bombe\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_010"
msgid "Obtain sensitive info.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir infos sensibles.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_011"
msgid "Guard's\\n"
msgstr "Garde: \\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_012"
msgid "Sensitive info\\n"
msgstr "Infos sensibles\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_013"
msgid "Sensitive info\\n"
msgstr "Infos sensibles\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_014"
msgid "Picked up sensitive info.\\n"
msgstr "Infos sensibles obtenues.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_015"
msgid "Automatic gun activated.\\n"
msgstr "Fusils automatiques activés.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_016"
msgid "Too many hostages killed.\\n"
msgstr "Trop d'otages abattus.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_017"
msgid "Hostages have been saved.\\n"
msgstr "Otages sauvés.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_018"
msgid "Sensitive information has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Informations sensibles détruites.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_019"
msgid "Carrington has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Carrington abattu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_020"
msgid "Joanna - we're under attack.\\n"
msgstr "Joanna - nous sommes attaqués. \\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_021"
msgid "Get the guns back on line - hurry.\\n"
msgstr "Branchez les fusils - vite.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_022"
msgid "The Skedar have taken hostages.\\n"
msgstr "Les Skedars ont pris des otages. \\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_023"
msgid "Get up to the offices and save them.\\n"
msgstr "Montez aux bureaux et sauvez-les.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_024"
msgid "They're using a new form of shield technology.\\n"
msgstr "Ils utilisent un nouveau système de bouclier. \\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_025"
msgid "Foster was working on a new weapon which may \\nbe useful.\\n"
msgstr "Foster travaillait sur une nouvelle arme qui \\npeut être utile.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_026"
msgid "Damn it. My office... If they get access...\\n"
msgstr "Bon sang. Mon bureau... S'ils y ont accès...\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_027"
msgid "Get there first, Jo, and destroy the files.\\n"
msgstr "Allez-y en premier, Joanna, et détruisez les fichiers.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_028"
msgid "Things are desperate. They've planted a bomb.\\n"
msgstr "Il y a urgence. Ils ont placé une bombe. \\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_029"
msgid "Find it and get it out of the building.\\n"
msgstr "Trouvez-la et sortez de l'immeuble.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_030"
msgid "Access denied - authorization failure.\\n"
msgstr "Accès refusé - Echec autorisation. \\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_031"
msgid "Emergency overrides have been engaged.\\n"
msgstr "Mesures d'urgences lancées.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_032"
msgid "Well done, Joanna. We're nearly clear...\\n"
msgstr "Beau boulot, Joanna. C'est presque fini...\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_033"
msgid "The last dropship is waiting for you. Hurry.\\n"
msgstr "La dernière navette vous attend. Faites vite.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_034"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_035"
msgid "The autodefenses will really help me out.\\n"
msgstr "Les défenses automatiques vont m'aider.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_036"
msgid "So this is what Foster was working on.\\n"
msgstr "Voilà sur quoi Foster travaillait.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_037"
msgid "I'll have to go carefully... The hostages are \\ncounting on me.\\n"
msgstr "Je dois y aller doucement... Les otages \\ncomptent sur moi.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_038"
msgid "Well, at least I won't know if I'm doing \\nanything wrong.\\n"
msgstr "Au moins je ne saurai pas s'y je m'y \\nprends mal.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_039"
msgid "The bomb has been detonated...\\n"
msgstr "La bombe a explosé...\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_040"
msgid "You have been given a Devastator.\\n"
msgstr "Vous recevez un Devastator.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_041"
msgid ""
"All ready, Joanna? We can't keep the Maian delegation waiting. Or the "
"President, of course.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Prête, Joanna? Nous ne pouvons pas faire attendre la délégation maian. Le "
"Président non plus, bien sûr.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_042"
msgid ""
"Am I ready? What do you mean? I was ready half an hour ago. It was you "
"holding us up!\\n"
msgstr ""
"Moi prête? Pardon? Je suis prête depuis une demi-heure! C'est moi qui vous "
"attends!\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_043"
msgid ""
"But you know how it is, Joanna... I had to make sure my hair was just right,"
" and then there was the suit...\\n"
msgstr ""
"Vous savez ce que c'est, Joanna: il fallait que je me coiffe, que j'arrange "
"mon costume...\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_044"
msgid "They should keep you away from mirrors. Nervous?\\n"
msgstr "Vous avez combien de miroirs chez vous? Nerveux?\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_045"
msgid ""
"Very. I've waited for this moment for so many years. Contact, friendly "
"contact, between Humans and Maians is what the Institute was founded for. "
"And in a few minutes we'll be at the White House, and it will finally "
"happen...\\n"
msgstr ""
"Très. J'attends ce moment depuis si longtemps. L'Institut a été fondé pour "
"faciliter les contacts entre humains et Maians. Et dans quelques minutes "
"nous serons à la Maison Blanche... Le rêve deviendra alors réalité...\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_046"
msgid "Where did that come from?\\n"
msgstr "D'où cela venait-il?\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_047"
msgid "It was up on ground level...\\n"
msgstr "Du rez-de-chaussée...\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_048"
msgid ""
"Looks like someone doesn't know when to quit. We've got to get everyone "
"out!\\n"
msgstr "Il y en a qui ne savent pas s'arrêter. Tout le monde doit évacuer!\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_049"
msgid "Get clear! I'll hold them off... You can come back and get me later!\\n"
msgstr ""
"Mettez-vous à l'abri! Je vais les retenir! Venez me chercher plus tard!\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_050"
msgid "At least, I hope you can.\\n"
msgstr "J'espère juste que vous le pourrez.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_051"
msgid "You need the Data Uplink.\\n"
msgstr "Il vous faut le récepteur.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_052"
msgid "Connection has been made.\\n"
msgstr "Connexion établie.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_053"
msgid "Bypassing security systems.\\n"
msgstr "Dérivation systèmes de sécurité.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_054"
msgid "Virus has been downloaded successfully.\\n"
msgstr "Virus téléchargé avec succès.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_055"
msgid "Ship's engines have been activated.\\n"
msgstr "Moteurs du vaisseau activés.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_056"
msgid "Connection to ship has been broken.\\n"
msgstr "Connexion au vaisseau perdue.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_057"
msgid "Obtain Data Uplink.\\n"
msgstr "Obtenir récepteur.\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_058"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_059"
msgid "Data Uplink\\n"
msgstr "Récepteur\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_060"
msgid "A Data Uplink\\n"
msgstr "Un récepteur\\n"

msgctxt "L_IMP_061"
msgid "Picked up a Data Uplink.\\n"
msgstr "Récepteur obtenu.\\n"
